## 9. Risks / Considerations

- Enlarging snapshot may increase single payload size; mitigate with selective field projection and optional sections.
- Need clear invalidation (otherwise stale subscription/credits).
- Real-time channels could further reduce refetch (e.g., listen to credits, subscriptions, personas tables) but may be unnecessary if mutation flows are authoritative.

